    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This study used the theory developed in the literature to analyze the data obtained from a combustion tube run performed at 100 psig pressure and an injected air flux of 3.08 slpm. The results were analyzed in relation to two previous runs performed at different operating conditions. The results from these runs were used to study the effect of pressure and air flux on process variables in in-situ combustion.",
